/target
# The default tracing sink is `atlas.log` in the working directory, which is
# this one whenever the client is run with `cargo run`.
/atlas.log
# The tape in `demo/` is the artifact; the recording it produces is not. A GIF
# carries a particular afternoon's live numbers and cannot be regenerated from
# this repo, which makes it a worse record than the file that produces it.
/demo/*.gif
